# Several verification steps compare a committed artifact byte-for-byte against
# freshly generated output -- for example analyze-relational-experiments.ts
# checks docs/archive/research/strategy-findings.md, and
# run-relational-confirmation.ts checks strategy-confirmation.md. The generators
# emit LF, so a working tree that carries CRLF fails those comparisons even when
# the content is identical. Pin the working tree to LF everywhere so the checks
# mean the same thing on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
